Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.18,0:01:18.52,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&H247EB8&\blur4}若是乖乖聽話 笑容會綻放嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.52,0:01:23.19,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HDD2BAA&\blur4}所以為什麼向死而行
